---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Broken Heart Ohio" description="A tattoo studio with a full custom website, online booking, and integrated payments. Built from scratch. Going live soon.">
<style>
:root {
  --bg:#090908; --bg-2:#0d0d0b; --bg-3:#121210;
  --amber:#c4972a; --amber-dim:rgba(196,151,42,0.08); --amber-border:rgba(196,151,42,0.15);
  --red:#c45a5a; --red-dim:rgba(196,90,90,0.08); --red-border:rgba(196,90,90,0.2);
  --vessel:#7eb8c4; --vessel-border:rgba(126,184,196,.12);
  --text:#e8e6e1; --text-2:#a09c94; --text-3:#5a5752;
  --serif:'DM Serif Display',Georgia,serif; --sans:'DM Sans',system-ui,sans-serif; --mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;
  --gutter:clamp(24px,5vw,80px); --max:1100px; --nav-h:68px;
}
*,*::before,*::after { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0; }
body { background:var(--bg); color:var(--text); font-family:var(--sans); font-weight:300; line-height:1.7; -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased; overflow-x:hidden; }
nav { position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:200;height:var(--nav-h);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 var(--gutter);border-bottom:1px solid transparent;transition:all .4s; }
nav.scrolled { border-color:var(--amber-border);background:rgba(9,9,8,.93);backdrop-filter:blur(14px); }
.nav-logo { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--text);text-decoration:none; }
.nav-logo span { color:var(--amber); }
.nav-links { display:flex;gap:32px;list-style:none; }
.nav-links a { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;transition:color .2s;text-decoration:none; }
.nav-links a:hover, .nav-links a.active { color:var(--amber); }
.nav-back { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s; }
.nav-back:hover { color:var(--amber); }

.hero { min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:0 var(--gutter) 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden; }
.hero-bg { position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 75% 30%,rgba(196,90,90,.05),transparent 65%),radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 60% at 10% 80%,rgba(196,151,42,.03),transparent 60%); }
.hero-label { position:relative;z-index:1;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;color:var(--red);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;animation:rise .7s .2s both; }
.hero-label::before { content:'';width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--red); }
.hero h1 { position:relative;z-index:1;font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.5rem);font-weight:400;line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;animation:rise .9s .3s both; }
.hero h1 em { font-style:italic;color:var(--red); }
.hero-sub { position:relative;z-index:1;margin-top:24px;max-width:560px;font-size:1rem;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.75;animation:rise .9s .45s both; }
.hero-status { position:relative;z-index:1;margin-top:36px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1px solid var(--amber-border);padding:10px 18px;animation:rise .9s .6s both; }
.s-dot { width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--amber);animation:pulse 2s infinite; }

.content { max-width:calc(var(--max) + var(--gutter)*2);margin:0 auto;padding:80px var(--gutter) 100px; }
.section-label { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.62rem;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-bottom:40px;margin-top:72px; }
.section-label:first-child { margin-top:0; }
.section-label::before { content:'';width:20px;height:1px;background:var(--amber); }
.section-label::after { content:'';flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--amber-border); }

.feature-grid { display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:2px;background:var(--amber-border); }
.feature { background:var(--bg-2);padding:36px 32px; }
.feature-icon { font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:16px; }
.feature-title { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-.015em;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--text); }
.feature-desc { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.65rem;color:var(--text-3);line-height:1.7; }

.coming-soon { background:var(--red-dim);border:1px solid var(--red-border);border-left:3px solid var(--red);padding:32px 40px;margin-top:72px; }
.coming-soon-label { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;color:var(--red);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px; }
.coming-soon h2 { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:400;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--text); }
.coming-soon p { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.68rem;color:var(--text-2);line-height:1.7; }

.detail-grid { display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;background:var(--amber-border); }
.detail { background:var(--bg-2);padding:32px 36px; }
.detail-label { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.56rem;color:var(--amber);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px; }
.detail-val { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text); }
.detail-desc { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.63rem;color:var(--text-3);margin-top:6px;line-height:1.6; }

.site-footer { border-top:1px solid var(--amber-border);padding:44px var(--gutter);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;max-width:calc(var(--max) + var(--gutter)*2);margin:0 auto; }
.footer-logo { font-family:var(--serif);font-size:.95rem;color:var(--text-3); }
.footer-logo span { color:var(--amber); }
.footer-copy { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.58rem;color:var(--text-3);letter-spacing:.07em; }

@keyframes rise { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)} }
@keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1} 50%{opacity:.4} }
@media(max-width:768px) {
  .feature-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .detail-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
  .nav-links { display:none; }
  .nav-hamburger { display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;background:none;border:none;z-index:300; }
  .nav-hamburger span { display:block;width:22px;height:1.5px;background:var(--text-3);transition:all .3s; }
  .nav-hamburger.open span:nth-child(1) { transform:translateY(6.5px) rotate(45deg);background:var(--amber); }
  .nav-hamburger.open span:nth-child(2) { opacity:0; }
  .nav-hamburger.open span:nth-child(3) { transform:translateY(-6.5px) rotate(-45deg);background:var(--amber); }
  .nav-mobile-menu { display:none;position:fixed;top:var(--nav-h);left:0;right:0;bottom:0;background:rgba(9,9,8,.97);z-index:199;flex-direction:column;padding:40px var(--gutter);gap:0;overflow-y:auto; }
  .nav-mobile-menu.open { display:flex; }
  .nav-mobile-menu a { font-family:var(--mono);font-size:.9rem;color:var(--text-2);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--amber-border);text-decoration:none;transition:color .2s,padding-left .2s; }
  .nav-mobile-menu a:hover { color:var(--amber);padding-left:8px; }
  .nav-mobile-menu .nav-mobile-fund { margin-top:32px;border:1px solid var(--amber-border);padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.12em; }
}
</style>

<nav id="nav">
  <a class="nav-logo" href="/">matter<span>unknown</span></a>
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="/start">Start Here</a></li>
    <li><a href="/writing">Writing</a></li>
    <li><a href="/studio" class="active">Studio</a></li>
    <li><a href="/projects">Lab</a></li>
    <li><a href="/about">About</a></li>
    <li><a href="/fund">Fund</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a class="nav-back" href="/studio">← Studio</a>
  <button class="nav-hamburger" id="nav-hamburger" aria-label="Menu" onclick="(function(){var h=document.getElementById('nav-hamburger');var m=document.getElementById('nav-mobile-menu');h.classList.toggle('open');m.classList.toggle('open');document.body.style.overflow=m.classList.contains('open')?'hidden':'';})()">
    <span></span><span></span><span></span>
  </button>
</nav>
<div id="nav-mobile-menu" class="nav-mobile-menu">
  <a href="/start">Start Here</a>
  <a href="/writing">Writing</a>
  <a href="/studio" class="active">Studio</a>
  <a href="/projects">Lab</a>
  <a href="/about">About</a>
  <a href="/fund">Fund</a>
  <a href="/fund" class="nav-mobile-fund">Fund the Research</a>
</div>

<div class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"></div>
  <div class="hero-label">Studio / Tattoo</div>
  <h1>Broken Heart<br><em>Ohio.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">A tattoo studio built the right way — a custom website, an online booking system, and integrated payments, all designed and built from scratch. No templates. No third-party booking platforms taking a cut. Just the artist and the client.</p>
  <div class="hero-status"><div class="s-dot"></div>Going live soon</div>
</div>

<div class="content">

  <div class="section-label">What's being built</div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">🖤</div>
      <div class="feature-title">Full Website</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">A complete studio presence — portfolio, artist bio, flash availability, style guide, and aftercare. Designed to convert a visitor into a booked appointment.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">📅</div>
      <div class="feature-title">Custom Booking System</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">A purpose-built booking flow for tattoo consultations and appointments. Custom intake forms, deposit collection, scheduling logic, and confirmation emails — owned entirely.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="feature">
      <div class="feature-icon">💳</div>
      <div class="feature-title">Integrated Payments</div>
      <div class="feature-desc">Deposits and session payments handled inline — no redirects, no Venmo requests, no awkward cash conversations. The financial layer built into the booking from the start.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-label">Build details</div>
  <div class="detail-grid">
    <div class="detail">
      <div class="detail-label">Approach</div>
      <div class="detail-val">Built from scratch</div>
      <div class="detail-desc">No page builders, no Squarespace, no booking SaaS. Every piece owned — code, data, payments, client list.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="detail">
      <div class="detail-label">Booking</div>
      <div class="detail-val">Custom intake + scheduling</div>
      <div class="detail-desc">Tailored to how tattoo artists actually work — flash vs. custom requests, consultation-first flow, deposit-to-confirm logic.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="detail">
      <div class="detail-label">Payments</div>
      <div class="detail-val">Integrated, not bolted on</div>
      <div class="detail-desc">Deposits collected at booking. Session balance at checkout. No third-party app needed on either side.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="detail">
      <div class="detail-label">Status</div>
      <div class="detail-val">Going live soon</div>
      <div class="detail-desc">More details added as the launch gets closer. The site, booking system, and payment flow will all be documented here.</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="coming-soon">
    <div class="coming-soon-label">More coming</div>
    <h2>Full documentation on the way.</h2>
    <p>Portfolio, booking demo, and behind-the-build breakdown will be added here as the studio goes live. Check back soon.</p>
  </div>

</div>

<div class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-logo">matter<span>unknown</span></div>
  <div class="footer-copy">Studio / Broken Heart Ohio</div>
</div>

<script is:inline>
window.addEventListener('scroll',()=>{ document.getElementById('nav').classList.toggle('scrolled',scrollY>16); });
</script>
</Base>
